# NOURCITY Monorepo API Playground
# Use this playground with the VS Code "REST Client" extension to test local services.
# Make sure your local servers are running (e.g. pnpm run dev).

@nickstire_host = http://localhost:3000
@statenour_host = http://localhost:3001

###
# ==========================================
# 1. Nick's Tire & Auto (Express API)
# ==========================================

### Get Active Specials / Coupons
GET {{nickstire_host}}/api/specials
Accept: application/json

### Get Reviews / Feedbacks
GET {{nickstire_host}}/api/reviews
Accept: application/json

### Mock SMS Incoming Message (Twilio Webhook Hook)
POST {{nickstire_host}}/api/webhooks/twilio
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Body=I need to book an oil change for tomorrow morning.&From=%2B12165550199

### Check Tire Finder Results
GET {{nickstire_host}}/api/tires/search?width=225&ratio=65&rim=17
Accept: application/json


###
# ==========================================
# 2. Statenour (Next.js & tRPC / Inngest)
# ==========================================

### Check Next.js App Status
GET {{statenour_host}}/
Accept: text/html

### Inngest Dev Server Heartbeat
GET {{statenour_host}}/api/inngest
Accept: application/json

### Mock Inngest Incoming Event (Triggering a Workflow)
POST {{statenour_host}}/api/inngest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "system/logs-cleanup",
  "data": {
    "dryRun": true
  }
}


###
# ==========================================
# 3. Statenour tRPC API Mutations
# ==========================================

### Promote Journal Take to Action
# Enforces single-execution idempotency by updating the take metadata
POST {{statenour_host}}/api/trpc/journal.promoteNextAction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "takeId": "your-take-uuid-here"
}

### Triage Inbox Task
# Triages a task via one of the 6 decisions (today, schedule, anytime, someday, snooze, kill)
POST {{statenour_host}}/api/trpc/task.triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": "your-task-uuid-here",
  "decision": "today"
}

